{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a strange land brimming with the power of the Five Elements. By your side lies only a tattered Celestial Master's Research Notes. Your mind is clouded, and crucial memories are missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger waits for no one. The viscous, sinister energy in the air and the distorted howls in the distance declare this place lethal. You must act immediately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, gather, build... Use the knowledge within the notes to carve a sliver of hope from the perilous wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, to truly live, you need more than just food, herbs, and shelter. For every unexpected event may point to a fragment of your lost memories, and every threat you defeat might unveil a hidden truth about this world. Craft talismans, command puppets, forge powerful weapons\u2014you must gather your strength to confront the eerie entities that roam these lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. At any cost. It is the only way to unravel your own destiny and uncover all its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Weather &amp; Random Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new start is a unique experience. Procedurally generated unknown maps, combined with a dynamic weather system of sun, rain, and snow, provide you with a rich and immersive journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/3b423be47a20b536fe118275e19517f7.poster.avif?t=1765191528\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/3b423be47a20b536fe118275e19517f7.webm?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/3b423be47a20b536fe118275e19517f7.mp4?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Building &amp; Husbandry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your three vital stats: Essence (Health), Vigor (Hunger), and Spirit (Sanity). Start from scratch and build your homeland with your own hands. Chop wood, mine stone, and construct various functional buildings\u2014from a simple shack for shelter to a fully-equipped survival base. Cultivate farms, tame animals, and establish a sustainable resource supply, enjoying the profound satisfaction of progressing from a desperate struggle for survival to self-sufficient prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/e64b1284f915198f660e5ae469033181.poster.avif?t=1765191528\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/e64b1284f915198f660e5ae469033181.webm?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/e64b1284f915198f660e5ae469033181.mp4?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfying Combat &amp; Diverse Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features over 20 unique weapons. Switch freely between melee blades and spears, long-range flying swords and lightning invocation, and even law-defying techniques. Adapt to enemy weaknesses and obliterate all obstacles in the most spectacular and effective way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/23c979e64ede9ea0c0e6714554098612.poster.avif?t=1765191528\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/23c979e64ede9ea0c0e6714554098612.webm?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/23c979e64ede9ea0c0e6714554098612.mp4?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Bestiary &amp; Special Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is always full of &quot;surprises.&quot; You might encounter mysterious merchants, discover hidden pocket realms, or even face reality-bending anomalies. With over 40 unique creatures and their corresponding loot, every exploration holds the potential for unexpected gains and perilous crises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/eccf599c97f5b1288035fa5fa18bd634.poster.avif?t=1765191528\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/eccf599c97f5b1288035fa5fa18bd634.webm?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/eccf599c97f5b1288035fa5fa18bd634.mp4?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4108160?t=1765191528","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/6b417c912f400d272ff22dd4144d1e2edf488938/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765191528","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/e491f662c3845e5a5b393d40af940d7e72ea43b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765191528","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/e491f662c3845e5a5b393d40af940d7e72ea43b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765191528","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Combat & Violence\r\nThe game features fast-paced fantasy combat. While the combat itself is not universally bloody, the environmental scenes may contain elements such as corpses and dismembered limbs, alongside dark creatures like \"Rat men\".\r\n\r\nHorror Themes\r\nCertain areas of the game (e.g., the \"Dark World\") are designed to deliver a potent horror atmosphere. You may experience dimly lit environments, eerie howls, tense chase sequences, and sudden jump scares.\r\n\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a strange land brimming with the power of the Five Elements. By your side lies only a tattered Celestial Master's Research Notes. Your mind is clouded, and crucial memories are missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger waits for no one. The viscous, sinister energy in the air and the distorted howls in the distance declare this place lethal. You must act immediately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, gather, build... Use the knowledge within the notes to carve a sliver of hope from the perilous wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, to truly live, you need more than just food, herbs, and shelter. For every unexpected event may point to a fragment of your lost memories, and every threat you defeat might unveil a hidden truth about this world. Craft talismans, command puppets, forge powerful weapons\u2014you must gather your strength to confront the eerie entities that roam these lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. At any cost. It is the only way to unravel your own destiny and uncover all its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Weather &amp; Random Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new start is a unique experience. Procedurally generated unknown maps, combined with a dynamic weather system of sun, rain, and snow, provide you with a rich and immersive journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/3b423be47a20b536fe118275e19517f7.poster.avif?t=1765191528\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/3b423be47a20b536fe118275e19517f7.webm?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/3b423be47a20b536fe118275e19517f7.mp4?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Building &amp; Husbandry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your three vital stats: Essence (Health), Vigor (Hunger), and Spirit (Sanity). Start from scratch and build your homeland with your own hands. Chop wood, mine stone, and construct various functional buildings\u2014from a simple shack for shelter to a fully-equipped survival base. Cultivate farms, tame animals, and establish a sustainable resource supply, enjoying the profound satisfaction of progressing from a desperate struggle for survival to self-sufficient prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/e64b1284f915198f660e5ae469033181.poster.avif?t=1765191528\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/e64b1284f915198f660e5ae469033181.webm?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/e64b1284f915198f660e5ae469033181.mp4?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfying Combat &amp; Diverse Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features over 20 unique weapons. Switch freely between melee blades and spears, long-range flying swords and lightning invocation, and even law-defying techniques. Adapt to enemy weaknesses and obliterate all obstacles in the most spectacular and effective way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/23c979e64ede9ea0c0e6714554098612.poster.avif?t=1765191528\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/23c979e64ede9ea0c0e6714554098612.webm?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/23c979e64ede9ea0c0e6714554098612.mp4?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Bestiary &amp; Special Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is always full of &quot;surprises.&quot; You might encounter mysterious merchants, discover hidden pocket realms, or even face reality-bending anomalies. With over 40 unique creatures and their corresponding loot, every exploration holds the potential for unexpected gains and perilous crises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/eccf599c97f5b1288035fa5fa18bd634.poster.avif?t=1765191528\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/eccf599c97f5b1288035fa5fa18bd634.webm?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/extras/eccf599c97f5b1288035fa5fa18bd634.mp4?t=1765191528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["\u751f\u6c7d\u6a58\u5b50"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108160/742d01ca803bcbd43554ec0e707360c84eeac209/header.jpg?t=1765191528","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4108160/21084350/4b874adfbcde05dca85f5643c01580e4ac1effed/1763653335/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763655502","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4108160/21084350/4b874adfbcde05dca85f5643c01580e4ac1effed/1763653335/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763655502","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4108160/21084350/4b874adfbcde05dca85f5643c01580e4ac1effed/1763653335/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763655502","id":257235291,"name":"\u300a\u6211\u4e0d\u662f\u5929\u5e08\u300b\u7b2c\u4e00\u4e2a\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257235291/2507565a187c58a15a46f17bb7e43551635c513b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763655502"}],"name":"No More Heroes","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 2.77GHz Quad-core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","r